# One of the images on hraj.si and in the README, regenerated per release by
# tools/make-screenshot.sh rather than captured by hand. The page's previous set
# was six years old and two of them showed a menu bar that no longer exists.
#
# The camera and the shader are pinned in the matching *-user.json, passed with
# --user-settings, so the shot cannot drift with the session and the real
# user.json is never touched.
#
# A different shader on the same position. Six ship; this is the one that looks
# least like the others.
